    "updated_at": "2025-06-04T18:11:15Z",
    "body": "I think previously iframe.srcdoc was the other place that came up as a potentially legitimate place that's not covered.\n\nPrepend I guess you could do via setHTML(newHTML + getHTML()) but that's still got a serialize, reparse cycle that you might not want.",
